		(property "Description" "Right-angle 2x15 header on the bottom edge (the slot pinout, docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md). Used: 5 V, GND, CAN, slot ID. Not used: switched / constant 12 V, 3.3 V, WAKE, LAMP, REV, the I2S rail, the audio bus, AUX 12 V"
